    "unconnected-(U103-BAT-Pad5)" "Net-(X101-OSC1)" "unconnected-(Q102-NC-Pad4)" "unconnected-(USB101-SHELL-Pad1)" "unconnected-(USB101-SBU1-PadA8)" "unconnected-(USB101-SHELL-Pad3)" "unconnected-(USB101-SHELL-Pad4)" "unconnected-(USB101-SHELL-Pad2)"
